          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 9211 11/76 21.9.51 TRING HIGH STREET (South side) Nos. 25, and 25a with rear outbuildings (Formerly listed as Nos 25 and 25A) GV II House, now 2 shops. Mid C18 front, rear parts probably earlier. Late C19 and C20 shopfronts. Red brick with plaster coved eaves cornice and slated roof. A wide 3-storeys, 3 windows, deep-plan house on pavement facing N with 2 shopfronts now occupying ground floor with carriageway through left hand end into rear yard. Upper floors have recessed sash windows with segmental arches, painted reveals and 10/10 panes. W window on 1st floor a canted oriel with 12/12 pane sashes, moulded cornice and ogee plaster apron. Outbuildings visible from Akeman Street have steep old red tile roofs. 6-panel double doors on street to carriageway. Listing NGR: SP9236611385"
    }
  ],
